   "text": "Observability (prod)\n- Langfuse (self-host) trace per query:\n  retrieved ids, scores, prompt, latency\n- interviewer thumbs up/down -> new\n  golden examples\n- CI gate: fail build if Recall@5 or\n  faithfulness drops vs last run",
   "originalText": "Observability (prod)\n- Langfuse (self-host) trace per query:\n  retrieved ids, scores, prompt, latency\n- interviewer thumbs up/down -> new\n  golden examples\n- CI gate: fail build if Recall@5 or\n  faithfulness drops vs last run",
